  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1dc66e9658df9284f81f0664a7ee2889, type: 3}
  m_Name: IreneGraveyardCollectible
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CollectableEntries
  entryTitle: A Note from Irene
  description: 
  neutralDescription: "Others have always said that Echo is hard to read, but for
    the longest time, I felt that we were close enough for that not to be the case
    for me. Today, though, something felt\u2026different. I\u2019m still happy that
    they tagged along, but I worry it doesn\u2019t mean as much to them as it used
    to. Maybe they\u2019re just tired."
  negativeDescription: "What even was today? I don\u2019t know if Echo woke up on
    the wrong side of the bed or something, but it seemed like they didn\u2019t even
    want to tag along for the visit. They forgot they brought the flowers, dozed
    off while Reed was talking to them, it didn\u2019t even seem like they wanted
    to get out of bed in the first place. Echo\u2026I thought this meant something
    to us. What happened?"
  positiveDescription: "I wish I could tell Echo how much this visit meant to me.
    I\u2019m sure it affects them too, but I really haven\u2019t been the same ever
    since Penelope left us. I feel like part of me is missing, and has been for some
    time. Moments like these, where we can go through it together, make it just a
    little easier. I hope they can sleep a little better tonight."
